{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-11","kind":"proposition","title":"从平面外一点向平面作垂线","englishTitle":"From a given elevated point to draw a straight line perpendicular to a given plane.","book":11,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","contentId":"euclid-11-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5afb8bf3a02b576f5a884396c1e4d3ba313a0c20ba7d77945507bb9ef5b5446c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-11.statement","euclid-11-11.construction.1","euclid-11-11.construction.2","euclid-11-11.proof.1","euclid-11-11.proof.2","euclid-11-11.proof.3","euclid-11-11.proof.4","euclid-11-11.proof.5","euclid-11-11.proof.6","euclid-11-11.proof.7","euclid-11-11.proof.8","euclid-11-11.proof.9","euclid-11-11.conclusion","euclid-11-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44f75d9ec0901c96553e2a2d5ee84e90d9b59aeca5ee2b36068b8f8ea84fc335","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From a given elevated point to draw a straight line perpendicular to a given plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从一个给定的高度, 直线直直直直直直到一个给定的平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85711935da3cd3b9c0f6893fc74b56cbc49c2f3f87285add711b8e13b307a277","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be the given elevated point, and the plane of reference the given plane; thus it is required to draw from the point A a straight line perpendicular to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是给定的加点,让平面是给定的平面;因此,需要从A点划出直线,直线与参照点平面相垂直。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df5855ab9d8bb79db481ce6dd246bdc4bfbd052d368cb1c07afc18f4dd0d7681","citations":["euclid-1-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any straight line BC be drawn, at random, in the plane of reference, and let AD be drawn from the point A perpendicular to BC. [[I. 12](/principles/euclid-1-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何直线BC线都可以随机绘制,在参考文献的平面中,AD线可以从直角的A点抽到直角的BC点。 [[I. 12](/principles/euclid-1-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fde6a62f196e72854bc6fb7a8f3e0500ab335b9cb7f30e6f55a434d5091cf18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then AD is also perpendicular to the plane of reference, that which was enjoined will have been done."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AD也是与平面参考标准相切合的,那么,就应该完成所要求完成的工作。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71ead9485466c97110b622f2f043fd3476c29c568e5a0c1728e1cea4ae5b27d6","citations":["euclid-1-11","euclid-1-12","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, let DE be drawn from the point D at right angles to BC and in the plane of reference, [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] let AF be drawn from A perpendicular to DE, [[I. 12](/principles/euclid-1-12)] and let GH be drawn through the point F parallel to BC. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,则从直角至BC的D点和平面参考点抽出DE,从A直线至DE,再抽出AF,再从F与BC平行的GH。 [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] [[I. 12](/principles/euclid-1-12)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded9bb055ae2e12de44e8258f2f638818c8e84af5bad2b65135d7c8996514880","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since BC is at right angles to each of the straight lines DA, DE, therefore BC is also at right angles to the plane through ED, DA. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BC是DA线的直角,DE线,BC线的每条线,直角至平面至ED,DA线的每条线。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93d92f71a45ee03a4167c9d1e0db204d5c3854fd60a6b9dd0c51ab2effff733a","citations":["euclid-11-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And GH is parallel to it; but, if two straight lines be parallel, and one of them be at right angles to any plane, the remaining one will also be at right angles to the same plane; [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)] therefore GH is also at right angles to the plane through ED, DA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH线是平行的,但是,如果两条直线是平行的,其中一条线是直角线,平面线是直角线,其余一条线也是直角线,平面线是平面线,ED线是DA线。 [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87f61927938b57920e7f4909ce1ea03f2177b32c4b7a85cd8088ca8da7feea45","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GH is also at right angles to all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane through ED, DA. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,所有相交的直线线,在平面至ED之间,DA之间,GH是直角。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d9bfecddbdac24a92e517da1b48f23ab290304081a7725fb401529ad6e64c90","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF meets it and is in the plane through ED, DA; therefore GH is at right angles to FA, so that FA is also at right angles to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AF是相交的,在平面至ED、DA之间;因此,GH是直角至FA,FA也是直角至GH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef73dfbdbdf385d088b439e531da8bf6662388ddba6cfd83d35f92162d567cf9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF is also at right angles to DE; therefore AF is at right angles to each of the straight lines GH, DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AF也是直角至DE,因此AF是GH、DE直线各直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67d2dd2073eb5103e99efa92a1dd4557520836ad3333468ee3c2c3acc5ae3c3f","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if a straight line be set up at right angles to two straight lines which cut one another, at the point of section, it will also be at right angles to the plane through them; [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)] therefore FA is at right angles to the plane through ED, GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果在直角至2条直线上设置一条直线,在段点相互分隔,则在直角至平面之间通过这些直线;因此,FA直线在直角至平面至ED之间,GH直线。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9ba00acd5566a224640f122038b31c0a25122769056933059f7a82984ffe840","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the plane through ED, GH is the plane of reference; therefore AF is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平面至ED,GH是平面参考;因此,AF是直角至平面参考。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37a61cd20dc345268055242dc13749ff7fe8236313b1507c5c8bad370d14de43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore from the given elevated point A the straight line AF has been drawn perpendicular to the plane of reference. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从给定的A高度,AF直线划为与参考线平面垂直。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-11.source","contentId":"euclid-11-11","revisionId":"euclid-11-11@raw-5afb8bf3a02b576f","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b0ff381e85679b356d6becb29293e4fa2b6065eb2ec042a46e9c837698ccebd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-1-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.construction.2","euclid-11-11.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"I. 12"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-1-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"I. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-11-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.proof.3","euclid-11-11.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"XI. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-11-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"XI. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-11:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-11.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-12:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-12.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"XI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-26:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-26.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"XI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-17:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-17.construction.5","euclid-12-17.construction.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.17","sourceU